This is so off-topic it's not even funny, but as I've been accused
of threatening to unsubscribe someone for idealogical reasons (an
accusation which I find very offensive), I feel the need to keep
this here.  Those of you who don't care (i.e. almost all of you) can
feel free to skip this mail.  There is no Lojbanic information
herein.

